{"scene_description":"The image depicts the interior of a large warehouse or storage facility. The floor is concrete and there are high ceilings with exposed beams. There are multiple levels of shelving, some with metal frames and others with yellow frames. The shelves are filled with various items including boxes, crates, and pallets. There are two forklifts visible in the image, one red and black and another orange and black. Both forklifts have "REWE" written on them. The lighting is bright, likely from overhead fixtures, and the overall atmosphere appears to be industrial and functional."}

{"objects":[{"id":1,"label":"Forklift 1","observation":"A red and black forklift is parked near the left side of the image. It has 'REWE' written on it and is positioned next to a stack of black crates. The forklift's forks are down and it appears to be stationary. The forklift has a black seat and controls on the right side. The front of the forklift is facing towards the right side of the image."},{"id":2,"label":"Forklift 2","observation":"An orange and black forklift is parked near the right side of the image. It also has 'REWE' written on it. This forklift is positioned in front of a stack of green boxes on a shelf. The forklift's forks are down and it appears to be stationary. The forklift has a black seat and controls on the right side. The front of the forklift is facing towards the left side of the image."}]}

